2026-11-01T01:26:20.0408026Z -- Input staleness watchdog (item 12)
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0408360Z   ok   a fresh sensor reads normally
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0408648Z   ok   an over-age value is rejected
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0409303Z   ok   the rejected value is still available for a graceful fallback
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0409832Z   ok   the age is reported so a user can see why
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0410315Z   ok   an outdoor reading may be older than an indoor one
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0410774Z   ok   the watchdog can be switched off entirely
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0411096Z   ok   the age limit can be relaxed
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0411411Z   ok   a future-stamped state is stale, not age 0
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0411990Z   ok   a 4 h backward host-clock step flags the reading stale
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0412377Z   ok   unavailable is distinguished from stale
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0412709Z   ok   a missing entity is reported as such
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0413034Z   ok   an unconfigured input is not a problem
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0413359Z   ok   a non-numeric state does not raise
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0413733Z   ok   a non-finite state string is refused exactly like a word
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0414158Z   ok   a non-finite value is refused after unit conversion too
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0414751Z   ok   the °F path itself keeps working (null control for the guard above)
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0415219Z   ok   an untimestamped state is used rather than discarded
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0415569Z   ok   stale inputs are listed
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0415854Z   ok   missing inputs are listed
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0416139Z   ok   the summary is human-readable
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0416429Z   ok   the evidence names the entity
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0416731Z   ok   the failing entity ids are listed
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0417089Z   ok   each failure reads as one line naming entity and class
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0417658Z   ok   watts are converted to kW
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0417931Z   ok   kilowatts pass through
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0418263Z   ok   an unrecognised unit is refused rather than guessed
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0418600Z   ok   a missing unit is refused
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0419573Z   ok   a power state parses to finite kW under the caller's sign policy, or to no reading
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0420427Z   ok   a power entity is normalised on read
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0421048Z   ok   a wrongly-united power entity yields nothing
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0421676Z   ok   an unknown unit reads as words, not a token
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0422631Z   ok   every word-valued failure class renders in words a user can read
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0423752Z   ok   an unconfigured slot contributes no source and no line
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0424259Z   ok   a °F temperature is converted to °C on read
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0424675Z   ok   the DHW tank's °F reading converts exactly
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0425049Z   ok   a Wh energy meter is converted to kWh on read
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0425451Z   ok   a kelvin reading is converted to °C on read
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0425826Z   ok   a °C state still reads bit-for-bit
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0426227Z   ok   an unrecognised unit keeps today's raw read instead of a guess
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0426501Z 
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0426806Z -- R9 N-clamp-range: the flow-lift bias reaches the plant's supply (D2-s2-02)
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0427459Z   ok   D2-s2-02: a 50 C plant against the model's curve is priced at 50 C, not pinned 15 K over the curve
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0428045Z   ok   D2-s2-02: the bias still stops FLOW_BIAS_CLAMP_K under the curve
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0429165Z   ok   D2-s2-02: a supply no direct plant runs at (degF adopted raw) is refused as a sample, not absorbed
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0429880Z   ok   D2-s2-02: a plant at the supply ceiling is learned all the way up
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0430741Z   ok   D2-s2-02: a stored bias this version learns loads as stored; a wild one is re-clamped to the supply ceiling
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0431777Z   ok   D2-s2-02: a restored bias at the ceiling prices no supply past FLOW_SUPPLY_MAX_C on the coldest curve
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0433067Z   ok   D2-s2-02: the supply ceiling is 75 C, so an 80 C measured supply is refused as a sample
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0434317Z   ok   D2-s2-02: on a curve above the ceiling the hot-side bound is zero, not negative: a positive bias lands at 0 and the cold clamp still holds
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0435273Z   ok   D2-s2-02: a non-finite outdoor temperature prices no curve flow at all
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0435587Z 
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0436000Z -- R9 N-future-instant: a persisted instant ahead of the clock (FI-sw1, FI-sw2, FI-sw3, FI-sw4, FI-rca1)
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0437359Z   ok   FI-sw1: a fuse-advisor stamp ahead of the clock, inside its month, does not hold the 7-day cooldown past it; an honest recent stamp still does
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0438878Z   ok   FI-sw2: a heavy-snow stamp ahead of the clock does not keep the damping on 30 days later; an honest day-old stamp still does
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0440044Z   ok   FI-sw4: three immersion events stamped ahead of the clock buy no margin; three honest recent ones still do
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0440944Z   ok   FI-rca1: a legionella cycle stamped ahead of the clock does not postpone the next one for the skew; an honest day-old cycle is not yet due
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0442074Z   ok   FI-sw3: a stored last_tick ahead of the clock reads as an outage (tvofi's rule, card C13); a real cut still does, and a plain restart, or a tick at the restart instant, still does not
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0442692Z 
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0443009Z -- R9 N-plausibility: live inputs meet their physical window (D1-s2-02, D1-s1-03)
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0443763Z   ok   a forecast row's out-of-window field is dropped to its consumer's fallback and a non-dict row is not stored at all (D1-s2-02)
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0444448Z   ok   a forecast that is not a list of rows stores nothing (D1-s2-02)
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0445369Z   ok   the stored forecast is the validated one: an out-of-window field is None and a non-dict row never reaches storage (D1-s2-02)
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0446587Z   ok   a fabricated forecast windows its source attributes too: an absurd temperature falls to the 5.0 C fallback and an absurd wind to the consumers' 0.0, while a healthy entity fabricates unchanged (D1-s2-02)
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0447793Z   ok   an ECL110 displace outside the commanded window never lands; an in-window one still does (D1-s2-02)
2026-11-01T01:26:20.0448615Z   ok   an out-of-window DHW sample is refused before any learner state moves, and an in-window one is learned as before (D1-s1-03)
