2026-11-01T01:26:20.3385542Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-11-01T01:26:20.3385687Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-11-01T01:26:20.3385871Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
