2026-11-01T01:26:20.3391265Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-11-01T01:26:20.3391429Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-11-01T01:26:20.3391585Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
